  "prefLabel": "Tre 303.03 Payment or Delivery of Abandoned Property",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tre 303.03 Payment or Delivery of Abandoned Property. Any person who is required to report abandoned property pursuant to RSA 471-C shall pay or deliver all abandoned property to the administrator at the time of filing the report except as otherwise provided in RSA 471-C: 8, II.\n\nSource. #7435, eff 1-25-01, EXPIRED: 1-25-09\n\nNew. #9465, INTERIM, eff 4-25-09, EXPIRED: 10-22-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tre300.html"
